OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours evacuated after hotel
OL,4,Afire can return
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvacuated residents have been allowed
OL,7,Fto return home 11 days after they were
OL,8,Ftold to leave their flats following a
OL,9,Ffire at a neighbouring hotel.
OL,11,FThe 90 flats at Pavilion Court in
OL,12,FFolkestone were evacuated the day after
OL,13,Fa blaze at the Grand Burstin Hotel on
OL,14,F19 September over concerns the hotel
OL,15,Fcould collapse.
OL,17,FFolkestone & Hythe District Council
OL,18,Fsaid on Thursday that it was "agreed by
OL,19,Fexperts that the exclusion zone can be
OL,20,Freduced" after an inspection of the
OL,21,Fhotel building.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
