OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours evacuated after hotel
OL,4,Afire can return
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Power has been reconnected to Pavilion
OL,7,FCourt and this morning the necessary
OL,8,Ffire and safety checks were carried
OL,9,Fout," the authority said.
